.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-LINKS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-links
.Nd public FastCGI surface for FileES shares
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
serves the credential-free public HTML and file/ZIP downloads.
It reads
.Xr filees-public-links 5 ,
not
.Xr filees.conf 5 .
It owns only a temporary cache.
It asks
.Xr filees-public-authority 8
for each leaf.
.Pp
The process uses no JavaScript, sets no cookies, and sends
.Ic Cache-Control: no-store
plus a hashed Content-Security-Policy.
Unknown, revoked and deleted addresses share one branded HTTP 404 that
does not echo the requested path.
.Pp
Listing iterates the channel's declared object map.
It does not walk the repository tree.
See the Public Shares chapter of the HTML manual.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/filees/public-links.json
Configuration.
.It Pa /var/www/run/filees/filees-links.sock
Default FastCGI socket.
.It Pa /var/tmp/filees-public-shares-cache
Private cache, owner
.Sy _filees-links ,
outside backups.
.It Pa /etc/rc.d/filees_links
Disabled-by-default OpenBSD rc.d script.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-public-authority 8 ,
.Xr filees-public-links 5 ,
.Xr httpd 8
